### escaped metacharacters are meaningful
echo a\|b c\&d e\;f g\<h i\>j k\(l m\)n
>>> none

### escaped backslash and quotes
echo back\\slash it\'s say\"hi
>>> none

### escaped dollar and backtick
echo cost\$5 tick\`s
>>> none

### escaped glob and extglob characters
ls file\? data\* user\@host wow\! one\+two
>>> none

### escaped brackets and braces
echo \[draft\] \{set\}
>>> none

### escaped dot, comma, tilde and hash
echo name\.ext a\,b \~home \#tag
>>> none

### escaped space keeps one argument
touch my\ notes.txt
>>> none

### escaped no-break space is not an ordinary character
